 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Wipe the mushrooms clean; do not soak them. Tear the oyster mushrooms <b>along the gills</b> into <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"1\" data-b=\"2\" data-s=\"0\">1–2 cm</span> strips.</li><li>Cut the stems off the shiitake and score a shallow cross into each cap. Halve the brown mushrooms. Cut the root block off the enoki and pull them into small bunches.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-1",
