  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Spread the napa cabbage and onion over the bottom of the cold pan as a bed.</li><li>On top, arrange each mushroom in <b>its own section</b> around the pan, like the spokes of a wheel, with the tofu slices and carrot between them. Put the seasoned beef as a loose mound in the centre. Keep the enoki and spring onion aside.</li></ul>",
