  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Pour the broth gently down the side of the pan so the arrangement stays in place. It should come about halfway up the vegetables; the cabbage and mushrooms release more liquid as they cook.</li><li>Cover and bring to a boil on <b>medium-high</b>, then lower to <b>medium</b> and simmer for <b>6–8 minutes</b>, until the cabbage is soft and the beef has turned brown.</li></ul>",
