   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Uncover and break the beef mound into a few large pieces with a spoon. Lay in the enoki and spring onion and simmer for <b>1–2 minutes</b>.</li><li>Taste the broth and add salt a pinch at a time; it should be lightly seasoned, like a soup. Bring the pan to the table and serve into small bowls with rice.</li></ul>",
